<?xml version="1.0"?>
<model>
  <name>PlaneSpike</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.9">model.sdf</sdf>

  <description>
    THROWAWAY spike/experiment model, not a real vehicle twin. Part of the
    Phase B ArduPlane-underwater feasibility check (docs/EXECUTION_STATE.md,
    2026-08-08 rebuild plan): a crude torpedo-shaped capsule with one aft
    propeller and NO control fins yet, used only to answer "does ArduPlane
    firmware arm and hold a stable EKF state underwater via Gazebo/JSON FDM
    at low speed" before any real REMUS-100 geometry or fin control is
    built. Mass/dimensions here are placeholder-scale (roughly torpedo-
    sized), not REMUS-100's real sourced values -- those come later, in
    Phase C, only if this spike succeeds.
  </description>
</model>
